              "content": "Upload a single reference image or video to be referenced by a later Supe search. Multipart form-data with a required `file` field and optional `content_type` override. Image: JPEG/PNG/WebP, max 20 MB, max 4096 px per axis. Video: MP4/QuickTime/WebM, max 500 MB, max 10 minutes. Processing is asynchronous; the response is 202 with a `pending` asset.",
              "type": "text/plain"
            },
