      "content": "Server-to-server REST API for the Soundstripe royalty-free music, sound-effects, and AI music supervisor catalog. Responses follow the JSON:API specification. Authentication is token-based via the `Authorization` header. The API rate limit is 25 requests per second per API key; exceeding it returns HTTP 429.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Soundstripe API",
